<</Title(As the GSLA share-out process unfolded with Life Helpers Staff, anticipation filled the air, mingling with a palpable sense of empowerment. Each participant, whether from Yobe State, Zamfara, or BUI, stood poised to receive their share, a testament to their commitment to financial resilience. With smiles of gratitude, they embraced their newfound agency, transforming the once-daunting prospect of financial management into an empowering journey. In this moment, as they received their portion, they also received a renewed sense of confidence in their ability to navigate life's uncertainties.)/Dest[25 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 466 0 R/Next 401 0 R>>
